{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/residence-110-select-group-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":492,"crm_id":"64","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Residence 110","slug":"residence-110-select-group-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2023","developer":"Select Group","price":2894000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.1776828,"longitude":55.2696948,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Residence 110 is a residential complex in Dubai. It combines modern architecture with premium luxury. The building has 20 floors. It was completed in 2019. The concept is simple: it's located in Dubai's heart. It has a limited number of neighbors and convenient infrastructure.</p><p>Everything aims at exceptional comfort. The apartments feature advanced concepts, materials, and technologies. Privacy is ensured with a maximum of 6 units per floor. Residents can choose from one to three-bedroom apartments with panoramic views of landmarks like Burj Al Arab or Burj Khalifa.</p><p>Wide windows provide natural light. Effective sound insulation is a key advantage. Kitchens have modern appliances, and bedrooms come with convenient wardrobes. Apartments with two and three bedrooms can have a maid's room with its own bathroom allocated. Some units have separate rooms for washing machines.</p><p>Amenities include a fitness center, a 24-hour pool, and a cycling track. Business Bay, where Residence 110 is located, provides easy access to different districts. The location allows quick access to main roads like Sheikh Zayed Road and Al Khail Road. Dubai's center is a 10-minute drive away. Attractions like Burj Khalifa, the Dubai Fountain, and the Dubai Aquarium are nearby. Shopping and entertainment areas, such as City Walk and Jumeirah district, are also within a 10-minute drive from Residence 110.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/dUpUBcnki0bSMTJAtjkF1kpzCJrcPZ6SCPCHhyi7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/dUpUBcnki0bSMTJAtjkF1kpzCJrcPZ6SCPCHhyi7.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/3wMcvdZcJnQP5HzyEpjcdLGzjgLZLRJm36u9TvFx.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/3wMcvdZcJnQP5HzyEpjcdLGzjgLZLRJm36u9TvFx.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/AUZ0YHEEzmYnhDyoq7BEQQhlDFyinyv5qFKyXqLo.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/AUZ0YHEEzmYnhDyoq7BEQQhlDFyinyv5qFKyXqLo.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/k4ssPT1VhZEg28IlvQruliDG4yLIHOKhDMP02biF.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/k4ssPT1VhZEg28IlvQruliDG4yLIHOKhDMP02biF.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/wlwSIbdlugQ1pQvVOKVTK3orb6cQvHR3zr8CwYNv.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/wlwSIbdlugQ1pQvVOKVTK3orb6cQvHR3zr8CwYNv.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/64/images/2023/6/12/20p7wkkGmCLpJxQIydsl2sHXeW4TA11ri80YtUns.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/20p7wkkGmCLpJxQIydsl2sHXeW4TA11ri80YtUns.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2945,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/06/22/ExzGp4bcktRQeQAjeqBWL0KdaK2gfVvYMAByEpOc.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1238,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"100% Full Payment","payment_plans":[{